#: video_xblock/backends/vimeo.py:144
msgid ""
"You can generate a Vimeo access token via <b>Application console's "
"Authentication section</b> by <a href=\"https://developer.vimeo.com/apps/"
"new\" target=\"_blank\">creating new app</a>. Please ensure appropriate "
"operations scope (\"private\") has been set for access token."
msgstr "您可以通过应用控制台的“身份验证”功能来生成 Vimeo 访问令牌。请确保为该令牌设置适当的操作权限范围（\"private\"）。"


