msgstr "视频"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:77
msgid "Component Display Name"
msgstr "组件显示名称"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:78
msgid ""
"The name students see. This name appears in the course ribbon and as a "
"header for the video."
msgstr "学员看到的名称。此名称将显示在课程横幅以及视频标题中。"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:84
msgid "Video URL or FileId"
msgstr "视频 URL 或文件 ID"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:86
msgid ""
"Video URL of the video page. E.g. https://example.wistia.com/"
"medias/12345abcde<br/>FileId for Tencent Player E.g. 5285890799710670616"
msgstr "视频页面的 URL。例如 https://example.wistia.com/medias/12345abcde<br/>腾讯播放器的文件ID，例如 5285890799710670616"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:95
msgid "Video Download Allowed"
msgstr "允许下载视频"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:97
msgid ""
"Allow students to download this video if they cannot use the edX video "
"player. A link to download the file appears below the video."
msgstr "如果学生无法使用 edX 视频播放器，允许他们下载该视频。"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:105
msgid "Video file URL"
msgstr "视频文件 URL"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:106
msgid ""
"The URL where you've posted non hosted versions of the video. URL must end "
"in .mpeg, .mp4, .ogg, or .webm. (For browser compatibility, we strongly "
"recommend .mp4 and .webm format.) To allow students to download these "
"videos, set Video Download Allowed to True."
msgstr "您所发布的非托管版本视频的 URL 必须以 .mpeg, .mp4, .ogg 或 .webm 结尾。"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:114
msgid "Account Id"
msgstr "账户 ID"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:115
msgid "Your Brightcove account id"
msgstr "您的 Brightcove 账户 ID"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:121
msgid "AppID"
msgstr "AppID"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:122
msgid "Your AppID of the VOD account. E.g. 1400329073"
msgstr "您的 VOD 账户 AppID。例如 1400329073"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:128
msgid "Player Id"
msgstr "播放器 ID"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:129
msgid ""
"Your Brightcove player id. Use \"Luna\" theme for all your players. You can "
"choose one of your players from a <a href=\"https://studio.brightcove.com/"
"products/videocloud/players\" target=\"_blank\">list</a>."
msgstr "请输入您的 Brightcove 播放器 ID，并确保所有播放器均使用 \"Luna\" 主题。"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:141
msgid ""
"Time you want the video to start if you don't want the entire video to play. "
"Not supported in the native mobile app: the full video file will play. "
"Formatted as HH:MM:SS. The maximum value is 23:59:59."
msgstr "如果您不希望播放整个视频，设置您希望视频开始的时间。原生移动应用不支持此功能（将播放完整视频）。格式为 HH:MM:SS。最大值为 23:59:59。"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:145
msgid "Video Start Time"
msgstr "视频开始时间"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:152
msgid ""
"Time you want the video to stop if you don't want the entire video to play. "
"Not supported in the native mobile app: the full video file will play. "
"Formatted as HH:MM:SS. The maximum value is 23:59:59."
msgstr "如果您不希望播放整个视频，设置您希望视频停止的时间。原生移动应用不支持此功能（将播放完整视频）。格式为 HH:MM:SS。最大值为 23:59:59。"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:156
msgid "Video Stop Time"
msgstr "视频停止时间"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:164
msgid "Upload handout"
msgstr "上传讲义"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:165
msgid "You can upload handout file for students"
msgstr "您可以为学生上传讲义文件"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:171
msgid "Download Transcript Allowed"
msgstr "允许下载记录副本"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:173
msgid ""
"Allow students to download the timed transcript. A link to download the file "
"appears below the video. By default, the transcript is an .vtt or .srt file. "
"If you want to provide the transcript for download in a format, different "
"upload a file by using the Upload Handout field."
msgstr "允许学生下载带时间轴的记录副本。下载链接将显示在视频下方。默认情况下，字幕是 .vtt 或 .srt 文件。如果您希望提供其他格式的字幕下载，请使用“上传讲义”字段上传文件。"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:183
msgid "Default Timed Transcript"
msgstr "默认带时间轴的记录副本"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:185
msgid ""
"Default transcripts are uploaded automatically from a video platform to the "
"list of available transcripts.<br/><b>Note: valid \"Video API Token\" should "
"be given in order to make auto fetching possible.</b><br/>Advice: disable "
"transcripts displaying on your video service to avoid transcripts "
"overlapping."
msgstr "默认记录副本将自动从视频平台上传到可用字幕列表中。<br/><b>注意：必须提供有效的“视频 API 令牌（Video API Token）”才能实现自动获取。</b><br/>建议：禁用您视频服务上的字幕显示，以避免字幕重叠。"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:195
msgid "Video API Token"
msgstr "视频 API 令牌（Video API Token）"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:203
msgid "Metadata"
msgstr "元数据"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:204
msgid ""
"This field stores different metadata, e.g. authentication data. If new "
"metadata item is designed, this is to add an appropriate key to backend's "
"`metadata_fields` property."
msgstr "此字段存储不同的元数据，例如身份验证数据。如果设计了新的元数据项，则需向后端的 `metadata_fields` 属性添加适当的键。"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:235
msgid "Incorrect or unsupported video URL, please recheck."
msgstr "不正确或不支持的视频 URL，请重新检查。"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:341
msgid "Failed to fetch default transcripts."
msgstr "无法获取默认记录副本。"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:786
msgid "Failed to convert file."
msgstr "文件转换失败。"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:805
msgid "Upload completed"
msgstr "上传完成"

#: video_xblock/video_xblock.py:835
msgid "Couldn't upload transcript text."
msgstr "无法上传字幕文本。"
